title Effects: a beat playing while a compressor, a drive, a delay and a reverb go on the drums, turned and taken off
covers fx-add, fx-busy, comp-moves
wait 1
mark beat
pad 1 100
button STEP SEQ
expect STEP SEQ: the pads are pad A1's steps
pad 1 120
pad 5 90
pad 9 120
pad 11 70
pad 13 90
button STEP SEQ
button PLAY
expect time: transport: Play
wait 2
mark add
tap header tab Mix
tap mixer look Effects
tap mixer fx-add Drums + FX
tap chain pick Compressor
qlink 2 +4
tap chain add + Add effect
tap chain section Drive and colour
tap chain pick Drive
qlink 1 +6
tap chain add + Add effect
tap chain section Delay and reverb
tap chain pick Delay
tap chain add + Add effect
tap chain section Delay and reverb
tap chain pick Reverb
qlink 4 +5
wait 1
mark busy
# Four effects on the drums for ten seconds: the report's fx-busy row.
wait 10
expect-not underrun
mark remove
# A tap on a slot finds it only if the effect went on: these taps are
# the checks that the chain holds what was added.
tap chain slot Compressor
tap chain slot Delay · Digital
qlink 1 +3
tap chain slot Drive · Soft
tap chain remove Remove
wait 2
tap chain slot Reverb · Room
tap chain remove Remove
wait 2
tap chain slot Delay · Digital
wait 2
tap chain back ‹ Back
button STOP
button STOP
